"text", "text": "## Human intervention needed\n\nThe automated job failed during reporter-requested test/metadata generation, after the native-image repair stage. Preserved work is available at https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-10318-fails-native-image-run-org.apache.pulsar-pulsar-client-api-5.0.0-M2-ef379795.\n\nEvidence:\n- The continuation marker identifies `generate_tests()` in the `explore` phase as the failure point.\n- All 3 generation iterations ended without a retained change: metrics report `generated_loc: 0`, status `failure`, and identical starting/ending commit `a120de9dbc4574bfa3eb0f744eaaf8aef90a0134`.\n- The native verification had already isolated the original failure to `ReflectionUtilsTest.loadsClassWithThreadContextClassLoaderWhenDefaultLoaderCannotFindIt()`, which attempted to load the synthetic shaded `ContextOnly` class. After removing that unsupported test, `native-test-verify/pi.log` reports 4 native tests passing.\n- The later generation attempts proposed replacing internal stubs with a public `PulsarClient.builder()` test and a `pulsar-client` dependency, but explicitly did not compile or run those changes, and they were not preserved.\n\nPlease inspect:\n- `logs/org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-api:5.0.0-M2/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-api:5.0.0-M2/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-10-07T00-00-42-625629Z.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-api:5.0.0-M2/native-test-verify/pi.log`\n- `logs/org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-api:5.0.0-M2/native-test-verify/cycle-1-runNativeTraceImage-2026-10-06T23-49-16-481709Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Review and apply the proposed public-API test update from the generation logs, or confirm that the checkpoint’s four-test suite is the intended coverage.\n2. Run the coordinate-scoped metadata checks and full JVM/native test lane for `org.apache.pulsar:pulsar-client-api:5.0.0-M2`, including the required native-image modes.\n3. Regenerate dynamic-access coverage and execution metrics, then verify they are nonzero and recorded before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_055ced975f0084ac016ac58c67aa1487d0bb3ca9f81756d1b2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 6051, "output": 1067, "cacheRead": 96512, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 516, "totalTokens": 103630, "cost": {"input": 0.024204, "output": 0.02134, "cacheRead": 0.0386048, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0841488}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791331416076, "responseId": "resp_055ced975f0084ac016ac58c58d09487d08c643f19442c4620", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
